1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,400
Every single day, enterprise data
arrives chaotic:

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Unstructured PDFs, messy CSVs,
and raw API payloads collide in transit.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,900
Unverified, untrusted,
and costly to ingest.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,700
A central orchestrator partitions every
payload across parallel worker lanes:

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,100
A Parser Agent extracts clean structure,

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,800
a Schema Normalizer aligns each
and every field,

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,200
and a Policy Auditor screens for risk,

8
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,900
all synchronized in real time.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,900
At the deterministic verification gate,
ten rule assertions

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,500
examine every single packet.

11
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,700
Malformed and hallucinated records

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,500
are deflected into quarantine.

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,900
while verified packets lock
into green blocks.

14
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:39,600
Verified blocks assemble into
an immutable audit ledger,

15
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,300
unlocking [REDACTED_AMOUNT]
in annual savings,

16
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,800
at 99.98% schema accuracy,
and fully auditable.
